\item Wikipedia entry: \url{https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/L%C3%B6y%C3%B6p_language}
\item Omniglot page on L\"oy\"op, which notes Codrington's 1885 documentation: \url{https://www.omniglot.com/writing/loyop.htm}
